cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PolyCARP: condition-aware prediction of copolymer architecture"
abstract: >-
  PolyCARP predicts copolymer architecture from monomer structures and reaction
  conditions and retrieves similar literature experiments. It combines an XGBoost
  classifier with a nearest-neighbour lookup to distinguish alternating, random,
  and gradient regimes. This release includes extraction and modelling code,
  the frozen paper dataset, trained model, evaluation splits, and a demo that
  reproduces the paper's performance table. The underlying dataset contains
  3,791 copolymerizations from 1,206 publications.
type: software
